{"id":"1c088d04d4303598","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-graph-unravelling.md","title":"以访问路径展开项图","display":"df-graph-unravelling — 以访问路径展开项图","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-graph-unravelling","aliases":["56-df-graph-unravelling"],"display":"df-graph-unravelling — 以访问路径展开项图","depends_on":["[[56-df-term-graph]]","[[56-df-graph-access-path]]"],"source_section":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.9","source_printed_pages":"717","source_ocr_blocks":[738],"source_verification":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-graph-unravelling"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-graph-unravelling</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph-unravelling — 以访问路径展开项图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a4fa7874f12cc27\" href=\"?note=7a4fa7874f12cc27\" title=\"56-df-graph-access-path\">56-df-graph-access-path</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.2 Definition 13.2.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"717"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>738</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"本地DjVu OCR陈述已比对；本笔记编码、推导与核验限制见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\">\\(G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"904f367f2b11cda0\" href=\"?note=904f367f2b11cda0\" title=\"56-df-term-graph\">56-df-term-graph</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Acc}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{end}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{end}_G\\)</span>、序列连接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span> 和空序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a4fa7874f12cc27\" href=\"?note=7a4fa7874f12cc27\" title=\"56-df-graph-access-path\">56-df-graph-access-path</a>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(q_i)_{i=1}^{k}\">\\((q_i)_{i=1}^{k}\\)</span> 为按该次序排列的有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_G^{\\mathsf U}(p)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(p\\cdot(i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{|a_G(\\operatorname{end}_G(p))|}\n\\qquad(p\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_G^{\\mathsf U}(p)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(p\\cdot(i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{|a_G(\\operatorname{end}_G(p))|}\n\\qquad(p\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_G^{\\mathsf U}\\coloneqq\n\\{(p,f)\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\times\\mathcal F\\mid\n(\\operatorname{end}_G(p),f)\\in\\lambda_G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda_G^{\\mathsf U}\\coloneqq\n\\{(p,f)\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\times\\mathcal F\\mid\n(\\operatorname{end}_G(p),f)\\in\\lambda_G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)\\coloneqq\n(\\operatorname{Acc}_G,a_G^{\\mathsf U},\\lambda_G^{\\mathsf U},\\epsilon).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)\\coloneqq\n(\\operatorname{Acc}_G,a_G^{\\mathsf U},\\lambda_G^{\\mathsf U},\\epsilon).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>展开的节点是根访问路径，节点标签继承终点的部分标签，参数是延长一个合法出边序号的路径。对每个源节点的路径长度归纳保证这些参数仍在访问路径集合中，因此函数和标签图均良定义。展开会丢弃原图的不可达节点，并把到达同一节点的不同访问路径分开；循环可能产生无限树。</p>\n<p>原书先按图同构识别对象。本笔记保留具体节点集合；路径编码给出规范的展开载体，后续可在这个明确编码上陈述字面相等。没有通过选择节点代表元定义展开。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的本地 Terese (2003) DjVu；OCR页块序号为提取文本块标识，不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-term-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-access-path","status":"resolved","id":"7a4fa7874f12cc27","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-access-path]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-term-graph","status":"resolved","id":"904f367f2b11cda0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)$ 满足 [[56-df-term-graph]] 的 $\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)$，$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-graph-access-path","status":"resolved","id":"7a4fa7874f12cc27","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Acc}_G$、$\\operatorname{end}_G$、序列连接 $\\cdot$ 和空序列 $\\epsilon$ 见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N_G,a_G,\\lambda_G,r_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TermGraph}(\\Sigma,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Acc}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{end}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(q_i)_{i=1}^{k}","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"a_G^{\\mathsf U}(p)\\coloneqq\n\\bigl(p\\cdot(i)\\bigr)_{i=1}^{|a_G(\\operatorname{end}_G(p))|}\n\\qquad(p\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda_G^{\\mathsf U}\\coloneqq\n\\{(p,f)\\in\\operatorname{Acc}_G\\times\\mathcal F\\mid\n(\\operatorname{end}_G(p),f)\\in\\lambda_G\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf U_\\Sigma(G)\\coloneqq\n(\\operatorname{Acc}_G,a_G^{\\mathsf U},\\lambda_G^{\\mathsf U},\\epsilon).","display":true}],"bytes":2072,"backlinks":[{"id":"ec93c08d698f2539","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-graph-unravelling.md]]"},{"id":"faf9dd8d1400edec","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"访问路径、展开、互模拟及同构谓词见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]、[[56-df-graph-unravelling]]、[[56-df-graph-bisimulation]]、[[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。"},{"id":"e42d17d6f02097e2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Acc}_G$ 与 $\\operatorname{end}_G$ 见 [[56-df-graph-access-path]]；$\\mathsf U_\\Sigma$ 见 [[56-df-graph-unravelling]]；同态谓词见 [[56-df-term-graph-homomorphism]]。"}],"outgoing":["904f367f2b11cda0","7a4fa7874f12cc27"]}